Adapted, not copied: the patterns below were reimplemented against this
project's own contracts, and several deviate deliberately from the originals.

  - the result envelope
  - the artifact registry
  - the config-once principle
  - skills/run-route/scripts/check-driver-read.sh — the allowlist-then-denylist
    shape of no-source-reads.sh, inverted here to default-deny
  - shared/runner/route-agent.mjs — the shape of its pipeline runner: one
    SDK session for one literal prompt, plugins loaded by local path, the
    caps and the tool list read from the environment, a wall-clock timer.
    The permission mode, the per-event claim and the verdict handling are
    this project's own and deviate from the original.

